WEBVTT

00:07:54.470 --> 00:08:00.017
(Applause)

00:08:01.018 --> 00:08:03.521
We've seen fathers accomplish goals,

00:08:03.562 --> 00:08:07.358
such as gaining shared custody
of their children,

00:08:07.358 --> 00:08:09.693
loving themselves again

00:08:09.735 --> 00:08:12.404
and gaining a newfound appreciation

00:08:12.446 --> 00:08:15.491
for everything they have
experienced in their life.

00:08:17.952 --> 00:08:20.913
All of our fathers enter our doors
feeling hopeless.

00:08:21.956 --> 00:08:23.374
But when they leave,

00:08:23.374 --> 00:08:27.086
over 90 percent of them say
they have an improved sense of identity

00:08:27.127 --> 00:08:28.337
and self-worth.

00:08:28.379 --> 00:08:31.215
We've helped fathers
released from jail and prison